@startuml
title Team Lead: current tickets of a team member (ADR-054)
actor "Team lead" as L
participant "Roster card\n(.tlm-card)" as C
participant "app.js section 20" as J
participant "Shared dialog\n(openModal)" as D
participant "GET /api/technician/team-queue" as Q

L -> C : click / Enter / Space
C -> J : tlmCardActivated(card)
J -> D : openModal(shell, "Loading tickets...")
J -> Q : apiCall (GET only)
Q --> J : tickets of the team (all statuses)
J -> J : keep assigneeId == member\nand status not VERIFIED / CLOSED
alt answer is still wanted
  J -> D : fill list: id, name, title, type,\nprogress, details (read only)
else dialog closed, replaced or signed out
  J -> J : discard the answer
end
L -> D : cross, Close, Escape or backdrop
D --> C : focus returns to the card
@enduml
